				<text_box x="10" y="8" width="1033" height="110">The Bass model of product growth simulates the population of potential market of Initial Potential Users. Click [Run simulation] to generate a new synthetic data set from a randomly selected uniform distribution of Coefficient of Innovation and Coefficient of Imitation. See the observed variables for the latent Potential users and Users users. Click [Export observed vars] to download a .csv file in wide format of the simulated data. Click [Export latent vars] to download a .csv file in wide format of the simulated latent variables, which you can use to compare results from estimating values using continuous SEM against the simulated system. Click [Clear results] to clear the graph.</text_box>
